## Package Installation

```bash
# Core App Kit
npm install @circle-fin/app-kit

# Standalone (if not using full kit)
npm install @circle-fin/swap-kit
npm install @circle-fin/bridge-kit

# Adapters — choose ONE for client-side
npm install @circle-fin/adapter-viem-v2 viem     # Recommended for Next.js

# Server-side (Modular Wallets / API routes)
npm install @circle-fin/adapter-circle-wallets
```

> **Required:** A Circle Console Kit Key for swap and bridge functionality.
> Set as `CIRCLE_KIT_KEY` in `.env.local`.

