## App Kit Swap

```typescript
import { swap } from '@circle-fin/swap-kit'; // or from '@circle-fin/app-kit'

// Swap USDC → EURC on Arc Testnet
const result = await swap({
  from:     { adapter: viemAdapter, chain: 'Arc_Testnet' },
  tokenIn:  'USDC',
  tokenOut: 'EURC',
  amountIn: '100.00',         // string, human-readable amount
  config:   { kitKey: process.env.CIRCLE_KIT_KEY! },
});

// ⚠️ Supported tokens on Arc Testnet swap: USDC, EURC, cirBTC only
```

