## USDC Decimal Gotcha

```typescript
// USDC on Arc has two decimal contexts:
//
// 1. As native gas token (for gas estimation): 18 decimals
//    → Used internally by Arc; you don't need to handle this manually
//
// 2. As ERC-20 token (transfers, approvals, deposits): 6 decimals
//    → Use parseUnits(amount, 6) for all token operations

// ✅ Correct
const amount = parseUnits('100.00', 6);  // → 100_000_000n

// ❌ Wrong
const amount = parseEther('100.00');     // → 18 decimal interpretation
```

