## Circle SDK Structure

All blockchain calls are isolated in `lib/arc/`:

```
lib/arc/
  config.ts     ← Chain ID, RPC URLs, explorer URL, faucet URL
  contracts.ts  ← All contract addresses (testnet)
  viem-chain.ts ← Viem chain definition for arcTestnet
  app-kit.ts    ← App Kit / adapter initialization
  usyc.ts       ← USYC deposit, balance check, APY query
  swap.ts       ← App Kit Swap (USDC ↔ EURC) — stretch goal
  bridge.ts     ← CCTP bridge — stretch goal only
```

**Never import Circle SDK or viem directly in:**
- API route handlers (import from `lib/arc/` only)
- React components
- `lib/inquisitor/` or `lib/ai/`

---

## Transaction Logging (Mandatory)

Every on-chain transaction must be logged immediately after confirmation:

```typescript
import { translateTransaction } from '@/lib/translations/actions';

await db.transaction.create({
  data: {
    userId,
    type: 'USYC_DEPOSIT',
    asset: 'USYC',
    amountUsdc: amount,
    txHash,
    humanDescription: translateTransaction({ type: 'USYC_DEPOSIT', amountUsdc: amount, apy }),
  },
});
```

`humanDescription` must never contain asset tickers, hex values, or technical terms.

